OL,3,GNEWSAChoir brings together people
OL,4,Atouched by cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,F"For me it's about awareness more than
OL,7,Fanything."
OL,9,FAn Ashbourne woman whose late husband
OL,10,Fhad cancer three times is raising her
OL,11,Fvoice as part of the newly-formed It
OL,12,FStarts With You choir.
OL,14,FBernadette Packer, 66, lost her husband
OL,15,FIan three years ago at the age of 55.
OL,16,FShe is now one of dozens of people
OL,17,Finspired to join the community choir by
OL,18,FBBC Radio Derby presenter Becky
OL,19,FMeasures, who shared her own
OL,20,Fexperiences of hereditary cancer.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
